      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲁⲩⲱ ⲉⲙⲛⲧϥ **ⲟⲉⲓⲕ** ϩⲛⲧⲉϥⲣⲓ ·",
      "english": "and he didn’t have bread in his cell.",
