      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:ap.45.monbeg",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲛⲁⲩⲙⲟⲕⲙⲉⲕ ⲛⲉⲙⲛⲟⲩⲉⲣⲏⲟⲩ ⲉⲩϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟⲥ ϫⲉⲙⲙⲟⲛ **ⲱⲓⲕ** ⲛⲧⲟⲧⲟⲩ .",
      "english": "They reasoned with one another, saying, 'It's because we have no bread.'",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 8 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:8",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲭⲱⲣⲓⲥ**ⲟⲉⲓⲕ** ϩⲓⲏⲣⲡ , ϩⲓϭⲓⲛⲟⲩⲱⲙ , ϩⲓⲧⲱϩ .",
      "english": "except for bread and wine, finding food and chaf.",
